#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:352
#, draft
msgid "Board recipes"
msgstr "Oidis do chláir poist"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:354
#, draft
msgid ""
"For the boards that publish nothing a standard can read. A recipe records where one board puts each field; whatever it leaves empty is filled from the published standards."
msgstr ""
"Do na cláir nach bhfoilsíonn aon rud is féidir le caighdeán a léamh. Taifeadann oideas cá gcuireann clár ar leith gach réimse; líontar a bhfágtar folamh as na caighdeáin fhoilsithe."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:412
#, draft
msgid "Page metadata"
msgstr "Meiteashonraí an leathanaigh"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:300
#, draft
msgid ""
"Reads the JobPosting most large boards already publish about themselves, for search engines. A published standard the sites maintain, so it breaks far less often than guessing at their markup would."
msgstr ""
"Léann sé an JobPosting a fhoilsíonn formhór na mórchlár post fúthu féin cheana, ar mhaithe le hinnill chuardaigh. Caighdeán foilsithe a chothaíonn na suíomhanna iad féin, mar sin briseann sé i bhfad níos annaimhe ná mar a bhrisfeadh buille faoi thuairim faoina marcáil."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:414
#, draft
msgid ""
"The fallback, for a page with no structured data: the title it declares and its readable text. Deliberately unambitious — it saves typing and never pretends to know more than it does."
msgstr ""
"An cúltaca do leathanach gan sonraí struchtúrtha: an teideal a dhearbhaíonn sé agus a théacs inléite. D'aon ghnó modhúil — sábhálann sé clóscríbhneoireacht agus ní ligeann sé riamh air go bhfuil níos mó ar eolas aige ná mar atá."
